# 📊 Prompt Template - Brief Competitive Analysis

## Purpose
Generate quick competitive analysis for AI products and features, identifying strengths, weaknesses, opportunities, and strategic positioning.

---

## 🎯 Core Competitive Analysis Prompt

### Prompt Template

Provide a brief competitive analysis of [COMPETITOR]:

- Competitor: [COMPETITOR NAME]
- Market Segment: [TARGET MARKET]
- Product/Feature: [SPECIFIC PRODUCT OR FEATURE]
- Our Product Context: [YOUR PRODUCT DESCRIPTION]
- Core strengths (3 bullets)
- Key weaknesses (3 bullets)
- Our differentiation opportunity (1 paragraph)
- Threat level: Low/Medium/High with 1 sentence why

